    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi Karla,</div><div><br></div><div>What you are doing in experiment.R seems very strange to me, but I don&#39;t think that is the main problem. Can you call &quot;irace --check&quot; and report the result?</div><div><br></div><div>If you do it from within R, then:</div><div><br></div><div>library(irace)</div><div>irace.cmdline(&quot;--check&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Manuel.<br></div>"
    ],
    [
